<h1>Bijan Robinson Signs Record <em>$66.75M Extension</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 6 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>💰 Breaking · Contracts</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">The hold-in is over. Bijan Robinson and the Atlanta Falcons agreed to a three-year extension worth up to $75 million, making him the highest-paid running back in NFL history by annual average. Here's what the deal looks like, and what it means for Jahmyr Gibbs.</p>
</div><div class="content">
